OL,3,GNEWSAMan trapped under fair equipment
OL,4,Ataken to hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was taken to hospital after
OL,7,Fbecoming trapped under fairground
OL,8,Fequipment in Leicestershire.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it was called Market Square in
OL,12,FLoughborough at 09:40 GMT on Wednesday
OL,13,Fto reports that "a person was trapped
OL,14,Fbeneath fairground equipment".
OL,16,FThe person was freed before the fire
OL,17,Fservice arrived and was subsequently
OL,18,Ftaken to Leicester Royal Infirmary by
OL,19,FEast Midlands Ambulance Service (EMAS).
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
