OL,3,GNEWSAMan trapped under fair equipment
OL,4,Ataken to hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a post on social media on Wednesday,
OL,7,FCharnwood Borough Council said there
OL,8,Fwould be a "reduced retail market" in
OL,9,Fthe town on Thursday due to an incident
OL,10,Fin the town centre.
